# Whitelist Policy: Ignore everything by default
/*

# Explicitly allow core project folders
!/backend/
!/web/
!/documentation/
!/mobile/
!/ai-service/

# Explicitly allow essential root configuration
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/render.yaml

# Downloaded data ignores
/products_data/

# Python / AI service ignores
/ai-service/venv/
/ai-service/.venv/
/ai-service/__pycache__/
/ai-service/weights/

# Handle nested ignores (optional but good practice)
# If you want to ignore specific things inside backend or web, 
# those should be handled in their respective .gitignore files or here with more specificity.
# For example, to keep current ignores:
/backend/node_modules/
/backend/dist/
/backend/build/
/backend/uploads/
/backend/dbdata/
/backend/images/
/backend/jsons/**
/backend/.env
/backend/scripts/

/web/node_modules/
/web/.next/
/web/dist/
/web/build/
/web/.env
/web/.env.local
/web/.env.*.local

/mobile/.env
/mobile/.env.local
/mobile/.env.*.local

# Globally ignore AI/Agent metadata and logs
**/.agents/
**/.agent/
**/.gemini/
**/.claude/
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/graphify-out/
**/.graphify_*
/support/
**/jsons/
**/auditreport_*.md
**/skills-lock.json